  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the democratic development in the Solomon Islands by strengthening electoral processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to contribute to the democratic development in the Solomon Islands by strengthening the sustainability of electoral processes. The project works with stakeholders including the Solomon Islands Electoral Commission (SIEC), the Electoral Office (EO), the civil society sector and various donors.</narrative>
  </description>
